commit 2c008011
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 11:56:24 -0600
subject: feat(observability): persist smart router taskType in usageHistory meta

- resolveSmartRouter now returns { comboName, taskType } (sticky-hit path
  re-classifies for taskType)
- chat.js threads smartRouterTaskType through every handleSingleModelChat
  call site (combo, fusion, capacity-adapter, single-model paths) into
  handleChatCore
- chatCore.js destructures taskType, adds to sharedCtx; sub-handlers pass
  it to saveUsageStats
- saveUsageStats stores meta: { taskType }; usageRepo now persists entry.meta
  (was hardcoded {}) — enables per-task-type analytics from usageHistory

Tests: tests/unit/tasktype-tracking.test.js — 2 tests verifying meta.taskType
+ conversationId persist at SQLite layer, and backward-compat empty meta.
All pass.

Verified: production build compiles.

Part of: Smart Router & Fallback UX plan (Phase 3 metrics)


